<br />
We're currently discussing things and I don't want to rush it. The general idea is likely not to prevent you or anyone from posting things, but to be considerate that several people are losing motivation and interest in their work and the community given the amount of stuff released, particularly the amount of half-finished stuff. Perhaps a good solution would be to collate stuff in topics, e.g. &quot;AI Ports by Haroldoop&quot;.</span><br />
